Bugfix: Fix parallel playback of multiple audio files

Fixed a bug where multiple audio files could play in parallel: media view
controllers kept their lock screen / Control Center remote command handlers
registered after another media item was opened, so pressing play on the lock
screen resumed every previously opened player. Remote command handlers are
now removed when a media view controller loses focus and re-registered when
it reappears.

